<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes.</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Weraung We Kodu Na Paulusi We Jemaati Na Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Weraung We Kodu Na Paulusi We Jemaat Na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio Aduna we 2 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyontarai na bendari Tesalonika we piana endoaoa eampa, ya esaneriru we awe Sen Yesusi ria we kodu eama pa. Kong piyana pa dong autang pitau na jemaati pai. Impaina Weraung We Kodu Na Paulusi We Jemaati Tesalonika pai nini, Paulusi soi we denyau ya parari autang yana pa. Embe totoi na Jemaati pai embuwua we Kristusi ria we kodu eama pa piana kikeu to. Impaina emaidai endupi wa, mana etamamang we Kristusi ki. Mana Paulusi doyo pitoai esanetatuata toyana pa pisarara pina. Wo Kristusi teweri to nunei eama wami, mana pimamunapa tawa pampong na nyontarai weanong we “Nyontarai Memuna” pai kong andi biateta Kristusi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi denyau nyontarai entato ne weraung nei paya, we ya etadu didiwa pa ki mana emunuara na endoao Kristusi pa. Ya koiri-koiri endupi na wemai we eserai pi weya, parari Paulusi kong ne pandura pa sitoru.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na weraungnei kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio retenang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari Sen Yesus Kristusi teweri eama pa kong dong mambabati wu nyontarai endoaoa wa paya. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi denyau we endoaoa paya we entoa maitui na Seni, tuturapi didiwa pitaubai etaduta na nyontarai endoaoa wa paya pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari We Memuna pai daria pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari topitotoi Allai diri nyontarai endoaoa paya we ne nyontarai pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:13-17">2:13-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio wepui pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Arera we pui pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />We manetapa mia na jemaati Tesalonika, aino nyontarai mesomi we tane Yai Allai kong Sen Yesusi Kristusi pa mia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Weraungnei napei antoru, aino yau Paulusi, Silwanusi kong Timotiusi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Kis. 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Antosanesara we Allai, tantamami pai ne madori piboki we rana tane Sen Yesus Kristusi, dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa derua mia.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawio Piboki kong tandau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Netapa mia, anemai mamo andi antorewa piboki pampang we Allai tutu topitotoi membeng toapa. Kong antoru piana andi antonari toyana, tutu mendoao Kristusi na wemai ea pa kong mesanewiwu waweria mia na paya era. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Impaina na awe antompaio Allai ne jemaati na nu ea wau yapa, na antosanerarong wetedai antotopang parari mene mendoaoa maitui na Seni, na uira kong kangkania we metadutapa na nyontarai neapa. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Pitau we metaduta yanapa denyawa we Allai kiutu kawio na wemai, impaina I kiutua we mia memai we metadu Ne riu we Mananu pa, tutu uira we nina ne metaduta we mendoao Allai paina. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Allai mamo wekiutu kawio na wemai dina, impaina I ingkai dona taweri didiwapa we nyontarai we etong mia metadu didiwa nina pa. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Kong dong ayaa pa we mia we nina ne metadu uirapa, kong dona konta we antoru, na awe Sen Yesusi wia na rora-marising maweu denyawi Netaraipai kong ne mampang paya, na Ne paya pa na adia weduruara rarong pai. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Kong dong mambabati pa we nyontarai we emaidai endearoang Allai kong emaidai etong parari Arera Weweng parari tane Sen Yesus Kristusi pa. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Nyontarai yana paya ingkai etadu mambabati muna-munai we woroi-woroi pa, mae I yo ya tori warui Renapa kong warui Ne paya we dea wieria pai. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Tau yana pa ingkai tawa na awe ingkai we koiri ki na Riama wane we Ne nyontarai emamarang paya aino ne nyontarai endoaoi paya kuira we etaparandini kong esomi wei. Mia tato mengkonta na a yani tutu mendoao piwe antombuwua pa paina. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Impaina antotandau pampang we mia imbaro tane Allai reo mia we memai we ne nyontarai mentuari di mia kong metongparari Ne awiapa, kong I dong paya we mia imbaro mempaya we metongparari pitoai mesanetatuata we menari pa na weng, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />imbaro na mia, nyontarai paya etaparanding Yesusi, tane Seni anompa, kong mia tato Yesusi deparanding mia, parari tane Sen Allai kong Sen Yesus Kristusi une weweng urona pinoma we mia eampa.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nyontarai etamamunai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Parari tane Sen Yesus Kristusi riama wane kong tampandura kong I pa, antorewara we antoneta pa mia,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Tes. 4:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />imbaro mendeo mesanekaeng wea pa pe. Mendeo mendoaoa parari arera we nyontaraipei doyo deduta na duainunungpei sopana pe, ete parari kawio we nabipa engkakera pa pe, ete parari nyontarai etoyo piana pa antotoi na weraung pei pararia to, topino Seni ne a we teweri ma pa piana kikeu to. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Topitotoi tato mendeo mendoao kawio we nyontarai embeangkari paya entopana toyana pa pe. Wo a yani riama wane wa, mana andi pitau nini pai kemang wo; aino nyontarai empau ingkai empika Kristusi kong Nyontarai Memuna we ingkai wemuna-munai pai ingkai denyawi netaraipai, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />na anerarong tedai ingkai biateta Allai kong deparandini we andi tedai raweina warui nyombatangnai we nyontarai esomi weya pa kuira. Kong ria meyoi na Allai Ne Manu Mamarang pai na bendari Yerusalemi mae doyo denyawa we iwo Allai dina.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:2">Yeh. 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan. 11:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Mesaneaoa we piyana pa piana ekawiora pampang we mia to, na awe enai kong mia pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Mae nina ne mia mesaneoa parari pitoai dongwido nyontarai memuna yani pai, impaina i ingkai denyawa netaraipai ki na a we Allai kiutua wei pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Tutu na anyuing, Paya we nyari pimamuna pai piana meriwa to, mana nina ei riu widori. Topino Allai pika we riuwidori pai mamo, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />na a yani pai di Nyontarai Memuna pai ingkai denyawi netaraipai ki, mana Sen Yesusi ingkai miuni na Ne aseng na worengpa kong nyari wemuna-munai na a we I ingkai riama pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Yes. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Nyontarai Memuna yani pai ingkai riama na Nyombatang pai ne paya pa. I ingkai nyari pitantuma pa pitau kong pi aneaerai pitau we donung na angkakari pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat. 24:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />I ingkai nyari pitau wemoyawa pa we weangkari nyontarai we ingkai emuna-munai paya tutu ya empikara kong esaneaoa wa anyau wetarai na Allai we kio pariri weya pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Aidonane Allai dong ya etadu kaeng pa, impaina dong ya endoao pi weangkari pa, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />imbaro nyontarai paya kuira we endoaoa piwe taraipa wa kong esanewe pimamunapa ingkai etadu mambabati pa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allai diri mia we metadu pariri pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Toyana ki mana antoru andi antotopang piboki pampang wu Allai tutu mia, neta we Seni anewiwu miapa, wo Allai na retenangpa piana diri mia we metadu pariripa na Duainunung Mamarang we dong mia memamarang pa, kong na kawio wetarai mendoaoa pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />We toyana pa Allai yau mia na Ne Arera Weweng we antobuwua we miapa, impaina mia tato metadu Yesus Kristusi, tane Seni ne wedea tedai pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Tutu yana pa, neta pa mia metoa maitui mae mendu na anyau we piana mentaraoa na antoru pa, na arera we antokawiora pa kong we antotoi pa. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Kong I tane Sen Yesus Kristusi, kong Allai, tantamami pai, we na ne weweng dona pinoma we tata kong piana dong riroi we woroi-woroi pa kong dong tata tasanesa ne weng we tata pa, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />topino riroi tata kong dong tasanerarongnei paya na mariwa tanari kong kawio tantopana we mai pa.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Tandau kong mariwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Interi manetapa mia mentandau we antoru, imbaro Seni ne Arera pa mararu topong kong nyontarai we entaraoa paya etaduta na wemai kong esomi wea, parari we piana tawa na mene madu kuira pa, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />mentandau tato imbaro Allai periri ama warui nyontarai etong amuna paya kong we etong wemoyawa paya. Wo nyontarai nea engkai wa we endoao Seni ne arera pai. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Mana Seni wo nukepana. I ingkai dong mesanerarongpa paya kong dewu mia warui mamunapa. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Kong antondoaoa na Seni, we pitoai antorekamana we mia pa, metong pararia kong ingkai metong pararia rai. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Antorewara wengki Allai dinti mia pampang kio mesaneao topitotoi I anewiwu miapa, imbaro mesaneaiwara na uira we metadutapa, parari Kristusi we aneaiwara na uira we piana deduta pa yana. <verse eid="2TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Mana antoru, antorarekepana we manetapa mia, na Sen Yesus Kristusi anongpa, imbaro mentapira warui meneta we emaidai enari ene mariwapa mae we empika anyau we piana metaduta na ama pa. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Wo mantau mia mendearona, topitotoi andi metong parari antorongtoapa, tutu antomararua wa we antomariwa na mene madupa, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />kong antorang nyontarai ene roweang pa na antombaita pawa, mana diru raida antongkai awiang, imbaro antondeo antorong didiwa we nyontarai pei tato na mia pe. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Antonari toyanapa mamo tutu antone haki pea wa we antorewa piea na mia toyana pa, wereria! mana pitoai antonari ne antosane we antosane anyawa we mia na pitoai antonaripa. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Wo na awe antonai kong mia na mene madukuirapa tato, antorong uara nini pai we mia: nyontaraipa matei meidai meriwa mamo reo dampi pe. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Antotopang ninane tutu antotaraoa we nyontarai peaya we embengpa embakakaiya kong emaidai emariwa, mana esamupa na piwe unawa. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Nyontarai we entoyasa antosua ya kong antoranyau ya na Sen Yesus Kristusi, imbaro ya aidisa mae enari mariwa enempa kong na toyanapa etadu roweang we mantau ya etang. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Mana mia mendeo mempowe metong wewengpa pe. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Nyontarai pei meidai tarao pitoai antotopana na weraung nini paipa mamo, mengkamani kong mendeo mempandura kongti pe, imbaro i memaya, <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />mana mendeo metoni parari mene marowa pe, mana mesuari parari meneta.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />I, Seni we madori piboki pa rana peima pai, topino dona we mia madori piboki pa pampang, na pipatotoi ea. Seni derua mia kuira. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Tabea we rana yau, Paulusi. Tabea nini etoi na mantau waraune. Pi nina pai we kamang na weraung we etoipa kai.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Topino tane Sen Yesus Kristusi dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa we mia kuira.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>